---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site.js';
---

<Base title="about" breadcrumb="~/about">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      i'm moe p. wellington, a 31-year-old artist from germany. since early
      2022, i've been experimenting with ai-assisted image-making in different
      forms.
    </p>
    <p>
      the recent work begins with a contradiction: the interface is a system
      designed for human comprehension, while the model encounters it without
      use, intention or literacy.
    </p>
    <p>
      i ask machines to reconstruct the visual language of operation without
      access to the logic it was built to communicate. what remains is a kind
      of false memory of software. worlds that seem navigable but refuse to
      explain themselves. i'm interested in the sensation of encountering games
      as a child, before their symbols had settled into meaning. information
      before literacy. systems before understanding.
      <em>the work of art in the age of artificial reproduction.</em>
    </p>

    <h2>contact</h2>
    <p>no contact form here. find me on:</p>
    <ul>
      {SITE.socials.map((s) => (
        <li><a href={s.href} rel="me noopener">{s.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
